{"id":1,"start":0.0,"end":2.513,"text_src":"- Hold it! - Don't shoot. We're from town.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2460.075,"original_end":2462.588}}}
{"id":2,"start":2.555,"end":3.601,"text_src":"A radio!","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2462.63,"original_end":2463.676}}}
{"id":3,"start":4.606,"end":7.626,"text_src":"Radio: The Butler county sheriff has verified that reports","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2464.681,"original_end":2467.701}}}
{"id":4,"start":7.661,"end":11.806,"text_src":"of murder victims being partially eaten by their slayers is true.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2467.736,"original_end":2471.881}}}
{"id":5,"start":13.982,"end":16.996,"text_src":"How long you guys been down there? I could've used some help up here.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2474.057,"original_end":2477.071}}}
{"id":6,"start":17.038,"end":18.426,"text_src":"That's the cellar. It's the safest place.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2477.113,"original_end":2478.501}}}
{"id":7,"start":18.461,"end":20.805,"text_src":"You mean you didn't hear the racket we were making up here?","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2478.536,"original_end":2480.88}}}
{"id":8,"start":20.84,"end":22.857,"text_src":"How were we supposed to know what was going on?","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2480.915,"original_end":2482.932}}}
{"id":9,"start":22.898,"end":24.866,"text_src":"Could've been those things for all we knew.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2482.973,"original_end":2484.941}}}
{"id":10,"start":24.908,"end":26.003,"text_src":"That girl was screaming.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2484.983,"original_end":2486.078}}}
{"id":11,"start":26.038,"end":28.298,"text_src":"Surely you must know what a girl screaming sounds like.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2486.113,"original_end":2488.373}}}
{"id":12,"start":28.333,"end":29.387,"text_src":"Those things don't make any noise.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2488.408,"original_end":2489.462}}}
{"id":13,"start":29.722,"end":31.947,"text_src":"Anybody would know somebody needed help.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2489.797,"original_end":2492.022}}}
{"id":14,"start":31.982,"end":34.535,"text_src":"Look, it's kind of hard to hear what's going on from down there.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2492.057,"original_end":2494.61}}}
{"id":15,"start":34.661,"end":36.879,"text_src":"We thought we could hear screams, but for all we knew,","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2494.736,"original_end":2496.954}}}
{"id":16,"start":36.921,"end":39.726,"text_src":"that could have meant those things were in the house after her.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2496.996,"original_end":2499.801}}}
{"id":17,"start":39.977,"end":42.949,"text_src":"- And you wouldn't come up and help? - Well, if there were more...","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2500.052,"original_end":2503.024}}}
{"id":18,"start":42.984,"end":45.21,"text_src":"The racket sounded like the place was being ripped apart.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2503.059,"original_end":2505.285}}}
{"id":19,"start":45.293,"end":46.926,"text_src":"How were we supposed to know what was going on?","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2505.368,"original_end":2507.001}}}
{"id":20,"start":47.386,"end":48.474,"text_src":"Now wait a minute.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2507.461,"original_end":2508.549}}}
{"id":21,"start":48.516,"end":51.111,"text_src":"You just got finished saying you couldn't hear it from down there.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2508.591,"original_end":2511.186}}}
{"id":22,"start":51.146,"end":53.498,"text_src":"Now you say it sounded like the place was being ripped apart.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2511.221,"original_end":2513.573}}}
{"id":23,"start":53.54,"end":55.842,"text_src":"It would be nice if you'd get your story straight, man.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2513.615,"original_end":2515.917}}}
{"id":24,"start":55.926,"end":58.145,"text_src":"All right, now you tell me.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2516.001,"original_end":2518.22}}}
{"id":25,"start":58.94,"end":62.079,"text_src":"I'm not going to take that kind of a chance when we've got a safe place.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2519.015,"original_end":2522.154}}}
{"id":26,"start":62.373,"end":64.758,"text_src":"We luck into a safe place, and you're telling us","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2522.448,"original_end":2524.833}}}
{"id":27,"start":64.8,"end":68.023,"text_src":"we've gotta risk our lives just because somebody might need help, huh?","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2524.875,"original_end":2528.098}}}
{"id":28,"start":68.058,"end":71.247,"text_src":"- Yeah. Something like that. - All right, why don't we settle this...","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2528.133,"original_end":2531.322}}}
{"id":29,"start":71.289,"end":72.293,"text_src":"Look, mister!","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2531.364,"original_end":2532.368}}}
{"id":30,"start":72.335,"end":74.009,"text_src":"We came up, ok? We're here.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2532.41,"original_end":2534.084}}}
{"id":31,"start":74.804,"end":76.821,"text_src":"Now I suggest we all go back downstairs","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2534.879,"original_end":2536.896}}}
{"id":32,"start":76.856,"end":78.865,"text_src":"before any of those things find out we're in here.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2536.931,"original_end":2538.94}}}
{"id":33,"start":78.9,"end":80.205,"text_src":"They can't get in here.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2538.975,"original_end":2540.28}}}
{"id":34,"start":80.456,"end":82.088,"text_src":"You got the whole place boarded up?","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2540.531,"original_end":2542.163}}}
{"id":35,"start":82.171,"end":82.925,"text_src":"Yeah, most of it.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2542.246,"original_end":2543.0}}}
{"id":36,"start":83.093,"end":86.148,"text_src":"All but a few spots upstairs. They won't be hard to fix.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2543.168,"original_end":2546.223}}}
{"id":37,"start":86.232,"end":89.163,"text_src":"You are insane. The cellar's the safest place.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2546.307,"original_end":2549.238}}}
{"id":38,"start":89.198,"end":90.969,"text_src":"I'm telling you, they can't get in here.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2549.273,"original_end":2551.044}}}
{"id":39,"start":91.004,"end":94.018,"text_src":"And I'm telling you, those things turned over our car.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2551.079,"original_end":2554.093}}}
{"id":40,"start":94.053,"end":95.818,"text_src":"We were damned lucky to get away at all.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2554.128,"original_end":2555.893}}}
{"id":41,"start":96.028,"end":99.794,"text_src":"Now you tell me those... things can't get through this lousy pile of wood?","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2556.103,"original_end":2559.869}}}
{"id":42,"start":100.423,"end":103.939,"text_src":"His wife and kids downstairs. The kid's hurt.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2560.498,"original_end":2564.014}}}
{"id":43,"start":105.99,"end":107.832,"text_src":"Well, I still think we're better off up here.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2566.065,"original_end":2567.907}}}
{"id":44,"start":109.255,"end":111.222,"text_src":"We could strengthen everything up, Mr. Cooper.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2569.33,"original_end":2571.297}}}
{"id":45,"start":111.432,"end":113.944,"text_src":"With all of us working, we could fix this place up in no time.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2571.507,"original_end":2574.019}}}
{"id":46,"start":113.985,"end":115.659,"text_src":"We have everything we need up here.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2574.06,"original_end":2575.734}}}
{"id":47,"start":115.701,"end":118.464,"text_src":"We can take all that stuff downstairs with us.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2575.776,"original_end":2578.539}}}
{"id":48,"start":118.506,"end":120.096,"text_src":"Man, you're really crazy, you know that?","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2578.581,"original_end":2580.171}}}
{"id":49,"start":120.265,"end":121.603,"text_src":"You got a million windows up here.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2580.34,"original_end":2581.678}}}
{"id":50,"start":121.638,"end":122.943,"text_src":"All these windows. You're gonna...","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2581.713,"original_end":2583.018}}}
{"id":51,"start":123.027,"end":125.664,"text_src":"You're gonna make 'em strong enough to keep these things out, huh?","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2583.102,"original_end":2585.739}}}
{"id":52,"start":125.706,"end":127.339,"text_src":"I told you, those things don't have any strength.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2585.781,"original_end":2587.414}}}
{"id":53,"start":127.422,"end":130.059,"text_src":"I smashed three of them and pushed another one out the door.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2587.497,"original_end":2590.134}}}
{"id":54,"start":130.143,"end":133.743,"text_src":"Did you hear me, what I told you? They turned over our car.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2590.218,"original_end":2593.818}}}
{"id":55,"start":133.827,"end":135.626,"text_src":"Oh hell, any good five men can do that.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2593.902,"original_end":2595.701}}}
{"id":56,"start":135.668,"end":136.841,"text_src":"That's my point...","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2595.743,"original_end":2596.916}}}
{"id":57,"start":136.883,"end":138.934,"text_src":"Only there's not going to be five, or even ten.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2596.958,"original_end":2599.009}}}
{"id":58,"start":138.976,"end":141.864,"text_src":"There's gonna be twenty, thirty, maybe a hundred of those things.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2599.051,"original_end":2601.939}}}
{"id":59,"start":141.899,"end":143.043,"text_src":"And as soon as they know we're here,","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2601.974,"original_end":2603.118}}}
{"id":60,"start":143.078,"end":144.501,"text_src":"this place is gonna be crawling with them.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2603.153,"original_end":2604.576}}}
{"id":61,"start":144.542,"end":147.808,"text_src":"Well, if there're that many, they'll probably get us wherever we are.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2604.617,"original_end":2607.883}}}
{"id":62,"start":148.477,"end":150.654,"text_src":"Look, the cellar.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2608.552,"original_end":2610.729}}}
{"id":63,"start":150.989,"end":152.622,"text_src":"The cellar. There's only one door, right?","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2611.064,"original_end":2612.697}}}
{"id":64,"start":152.664,"end":155.51,"text_src":"Just one door. That's all we have to protect.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2612.739,"original_end":2615.585}}}
{"id":65,"start":155.552,"end":158.734,"text_src":"Tom and I fixed it so it locks and boards from the inside.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2615.627,"original_end":2618.809}}}
{"id":66,"start":158.985,"end":160.198,"text_src":"But up here, all these windows,","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2619.06,"original_end":2620.273}}}
{"id":67,"start":160.576,"end":162.794,"text_src":"Why, we'd never know where they were gonna hit us next.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2620.651,"original_end":2622.869}}}
{"id":68,"start":162.829,"end":164.217,"text_src":"You got a point, Mr. Cooper.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2622.904,"original_end":2624.292}}}
{"id":69,"start":164.342,"end":167.148,"text_src":"But down in the cellar, there's no place to run to.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2624.417,"original_end":2627.223}}}
{"id":70,"start":167.44,"end":170.831,"text_src":"I mean, if they did get in, there'd be no back exit. We'd be done for.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2627.515,"original_end":2630.906}}}
{"id":71,"start":172.087,"end":173.636,"text_src":"We can get out of here if we have to.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2632.162,"original_end":2633.711}}}
{"id":72,"start":173.678,"end":176.984,"text_src":"And we got windows to see what's going on outside.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2633.753,"original_end":2637.059}}}
{"id":73,"start":177.361,"end":179.126,"text_src":"But down there, with no windows,","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2637.436,"original_end":2639.201}}}
{"id":74,"start":179.161,"end":181.463,"text_src":"if a rescue party did come, we wouldn't even know it.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2639.236,"original_end":2641.538}}}
{"id":75,"start":181.547,"end":183.891,"text_src":"But the cellar is the strongest place.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2641.622,"original_end":2643.966}}}
{"id":76,"start":183.926,"end":185.482,"text_src":"The cellar is a death trap.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2644.001,"original_end":2645.557}}}
{"id":77,"start":185.649,"end":189.25,"text_src":"I don't know, Mr. Cooper. I think he's right.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2645.724,"original_end":2649.325}}}
{"id":78,"start":189.752,"end":191.677,"text_src":"You know how many's out there?","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2649.827,"original_end":2651.752}}}
{"id":79,"start":191.719,"end":193.393,"text_src":"I don't know, I figure maybe six or seven.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2651.794,"original_end":2653.468}}}
{"id":80,"start":193.603,"end":197.119,"text_src":"Look. You two can do whatever you like.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2653.678,"original_end":2657.194}}}
{"id":81,"start":197.244,"end":200.928,"text_src":"I'm going back down to the cellar and you better decide,","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2657.319,"original_end":2661.003}}}
{"id":82,"start":201.012,"end":203.147,"text_src":"'cause I'm gonna board up that door,","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2661.087,"original_end":2663.222}}}
{"id":83,"start":203.231,"end":205.365,"text_src":"and I'm not gonna unlock it again no matter what happens.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2663.306,"original_end":2665.44}}}
{"id":84,"start":205.407,"end":206.788,"text_src":"Now wait a minute, Mr. Cooper.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2665.482,"original_end":2666.863}}}
{"id":85,"start":206.83,"end":209.886,"text_src":"No, I'm not gonna wait! I've made my decision, now you make yours.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2666.905,"original_end":2669.961}}}
{"id":86,"start":209.97,"end":212.481,"text_src":"Now wait a minute! Let's think about this.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2670.045,"original_end":2672.556}}}
{"id":87,"start":212.816,"end":214.784,"text_src":"We can make it to the cellar if we have to.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2672.891,"original_end":2674.859}}}
{"id":88,"start":215.286,"end":218.844,"text_src":"And if we do decide to stay down there, We'll need some things from up here.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2675.361,"original_end":2678.919}}}
{"id":89,"start":218.886,"end":221.398,"text_src":"So let's at least consider this a while.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2678.961,"original_end":2681.473}}}
{"id":90,"start":225.542,"end":226.713,"text_src":"If you box yourself in the cellar","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2685.617,"original_end":2686.788}}}
{"id":91,"start":226.755,"end":229.141,"text_src":"and those things get in the house, you've had it.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2686.83,"original_end":2689.216}}}
{"id":92,"start":229.184,"end":231.444,"text_src":"At least up here, you have a fighting chance.","confidence":null,"meta":{"source_ref":{"title":"Night of the Living Dead (1968)","original_start":2689.259,"original_end":2691.519}}}
